{"unit_id":"xie129716__computer-user-vision#card-zh","repo":"xie129716/computer-user-vision","commit":"e10491d868d7ed67ad1461b48fb9df32f2b3f8a9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"computer-user-vision（DSH Web 插件）：让 DSH 在 Windows 桌面读取屏幕并操作鼠标和键盘。它注册截图、控件读取、点击、输入、按键、滚动和窗口选择工具，并提供 /computer 授权命令。截图可直接返回给支持图像的模型，也可返回本地路径。适合让 DSH 操作 Windows 应用；需要 Windows 与指定版本 Node.js，不需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:148-175","src/index.js:335-350","src/tools.js:478-486","src/tools.js:769-783"]}
